  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\">DataAccessException</a></code> - in case of any errors",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"../../dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\">DataAccessException</a></code> - 如果出现任何错误",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>action</code> - the callback object that specifies the connection action",
      "translation": "<code>action</code> - 指定连接操作的回调对象",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Callback functions are responsible for creating a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> that defines the scope of how\nlong the allocated <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> is valid. Connections are\nreleased after the publisher terminates.",
      "translation": "回调函数负责创建一个定义已分配的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>有效范围的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a>。发布者在终止后释放连接。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This serves as a base interface for <a href=\"DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>.",
      "translation": "这作为 `<a href=\"DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>` 的基础接口。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute a callback <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> within a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> scope.\nThe function is responsible for creating a <code>Mono</code>. The connection\nis released after the <code>Mono</code> terminates (or the subscription\nis cancelled). Connection resources must not be passed outside the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> closure, otherwise resources may get defunct.",
      "translation": "在 `<code>Connection</code>` 范围内执行一个回调 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>`。该函数负责创建一个 `<code>Mono</code>`。在 `<code>Mono</code>` 终止（或订阅被取消）后，连接将被释放。不得将连接资源传递到 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>` 闭包之外，否则资源可能会失效。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute a callback <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> within a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> scope.\nThe function is responsible for creating a <code>Flux</code>. The connection\nis released after the <code>Flux</code> terminates (or the subscription\nis cancelled). Connection resources must not be passed outside the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> closure, otherwise resources may get defunct.",
      "translation": "在 `<code>Connection</code>` 范围内执行回调 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>。该函数负责创建 `<code>Flux</code>`。在 `<code>Flux</code>` 终止（或订阅被取消）后，连接将被释放。不得将连接资源传递到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> 闭包之外，否则资源可能会失效。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute a callback <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a> within a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://r2dbc.io/spec/1.0.0.RELEASE/api/io/r2dbc/spi/Connection.html\" title=\"class or interface in io.r2dbc.spi\"><code>Connection</code></a> scope.",
      "translation": "在 `<code>Connection</code>` 范围内执行回调 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Function.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Function</code></a>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the resulting <code>Mono</code>",
      "translation": "生成的<code>Mono</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the resulting <code>Flux</code>",
      "translation": "生成的<code>Flux</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
